[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="TallySticks" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-95, -200)
script = ExtResource("2_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the tally sticks"
flag_to_set = "oskar_tally_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]Oskar's tally sticks[/b]

Inside the toll-hut door hangs a bundle of hazel sticks, notched and split down the middle the way honest men keep a debt, one half for each party. But nobody holds the other halves.

Each notch is a barge Oskar has taken across for the Hollow men, three years of them, and the end of every stick is burned with a small mark: a day, a cargo, a name he overheard. It is the only honest account of the Hollow's river trade in the kingdom, and it hangs where anyone who knew to look could take it."
reexamine_text = "The tally sticks hang inside the door. Three years of notches."

