[node name="BrotherMarker" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(120, 400)
script = ExtResource("2_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the marker"
flag_to_set = "oskar_brother_marker_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]A marker on the bank[/b]

A driftwood post is sunk deep where the current runs fastest, with a ferryman's pole lashed across it. The letters cut into it have been cut again, year after year, so the river cannot wear them away:

HE WOULD NOT CARRY THEIRS.

River flowers, still fresh, are tied at its foot. Oskar's brother drowned saying no."
reexamine_text = "Someone has tied fresh flowers to the post again."

